    {
      "id": "8a255326-fb28-4bf8-b836-a5f6f8760470",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "##### Task: Value assignment\n\nNow use the code cell below to do the following assignments:\n\n* Assign the value of your G number to the `String` variable you declared.\n* Your G number start with G00 followed by six digits. You'll use those six digits to make the following assigments\n    * `firstTwo` will be assigned the integer corresponding to the first two digits.\n    * `secondTwo` will be assigned the integer corresponding to the second two digits.\n    * `thirdTwo` will be assigned the integer corresponding to the third two digits.\n\n    For example, if your G number was G00843759, `firstTwo` should be assigned 84, and so on.\n",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "8a255326-fb28-4bf8-b836-a5f6f8760470"
      }
    },
