      "id": "3d554b0f-897b-471d-ba95-7fda95e718b1",
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "source": "##### Task: Arithmetic operations\n\nIn the next code cell:\n\n* Write a statement that assigns the result of the following arithmetic operations to `firstTwo`\n    * Multiply `firstTwo` by 2 and add any value you want between 1 and 50.\n* Then do the same for `green` and `blue` using `secondTwo` and `thirdTwo`. \n\nAnd now you've defined your unique color.\n\n* Use one or more `System.out.println` statements to display the values of `red`, `green`, and `blue` in a form like:\n\n```java\n    red = 209\n    green = 79\n    blue = 145\n```\n\n\n",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "markdown",
        "id": "3d554b0f-897b-471d-ba95-7fda95e718b1"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d9e4fa68-6a13-4c2c-876e-e5f788957f80",
